findings.problem:
The lists were incomplete against the note, though P.R. asked what overlaps and what does not. Missing were:
- the string Fourier transformation (Freidel, Leigh and Minic 2015);
- the Grosse–Wulkenhaar model;
- Berglund, Hübsch and Minic 2023's "conjugate … in analogy with … momenta p are conjugate to coordinates q";
- the restatement of 14 October 2026;
- the evidence for "no velocity gate" (41 full texts swept, the static interaction law);
- the P4 row's "not found: … P.R.'s conjectures C2–C7" within the group.

Four smaller inaccuracies:
- "first stated" ignores the note's caveat that earlier undocumented talks could exist;
- "Unread … read in its chapter abstracts" contradicts itself;
- the shared-photon form belongs to the magnetic mirror (§11.4), the page the anchor links;
- #11 §10 and §11.4 are cited on the page but were not listed as sources.
